---
// Section 01: Hero (Editorial Live Music Marketplace)
// Headline: "Discover Sound. Collect Passes." (Punchy & Short)
// Centered layout with balanced viewport margin (Navbar h-20 compensated, vertically centered).
// 3D Card Flip (Easter Egg: no spoiler hints, smooth 3D flip on click).
// Smooth CSS hover (no rigid mousemove tracker).
---

<section class="relative w-full min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center pt-20 pb-8 px-6 sm:px-12 lg:px-16 overflow-hidden">
  
  <!-- Subtle Atmospheric Stage Glows (Directly on Page Background) -->
