        <h1 class="font-sans text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[76px] xl:text-[84px] font-black tracking-tight text-neutral-950 dark:text-soft-white leading-[1.03] mb-6">
          <span data-i18n="hero.headline1">TIKET KONSER RESMI.</span> <br />
          <span data-i18n="hero.headline2">BEBAS CALO.</span>
        </h1>

        <!-- Subtitle Paragraph -->
        <p data-i18n="hero.subheadline" class="text-base sm:text-lg text-neutral-600 dark:text-muted-gray font-normal leading-relaxed max-w-xl mb-10">
          Cari musisi favoritmu dan beli tiket resminya langsung tanpa ribet.
        </p>

        <!-- CTA Buttons: Solid Pill & Outlined Pill -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 mb-14">
          <!-- Primary Pill Button (Explore) -->
          <a 
            href="/events" 
